        "created_at": "2015-01-14T10:20:23.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>If a card that gets attached to something doesn't have any kind of \"When the card this card is attached to is destroyed, do X\" text, it just stays floating in the aether until it gets destroyed via ongoing/equipment desctruction or whatever. Compare Jim's bounties - they all say \"When the target is destroyed, do X and return this card to the trash\" except Ultimate Target, which instead stays sat there doing nothing until you can get it back (I think the Hat lets you destroy bounties).</p>",
